     * </p>
     * <p>
     * For example:
     * </p>
     *
     * <pre>
     * builder.setCommentMarker('#').setHeaderComments("Generated by Apache Commons CSV", Instant.ofEpochMilli(0).toString());
     * </pre>
     * <p>
